# "Other Cats you control get +1/+1" and "Whenever Arahbo or another nontoken Cat you control enters, create a 1/1 white Cat
# creature token" (CR 603.6a, 613.4c). Arahbo entering makes one Cat token (2/2 with the bonus; Arahbo herself stays 2/2: "other");
# the token's own entering does not trigger it (token). Bot1's Sacred Cat, a nontoken Cat, makes a second token and is 2/2; the Cat
# tokens do not make more. Elvish Mystic is no Cat: no token, no bonus. Bot2's Sacred Cat is a Cat Bot1 does not control: no token
# for Bot1, and it stays 1/1.

